<div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-pink-100 text-pink-600 flex-shrink-0">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-xl text-gray-900 coustard-regular">Role Call</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
    Before every show, Role Call checks that each show-specific role — a booth
    tech, a house manager — actually has someone on it. Any show still missing
    one gets flagged right in the day's show list on Scheduling, naming the
    roles it needs. Fully staffed shows aren't marked at all.
  </p>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
    A show that genuinely doesn't need a role (a rental running its own booth,
    say) can be excused from that one role — click the show on Scheduling and
    mark it there. Every other role on that show keeps getting checked.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-5 pt-5 border-t border-gray-200">
    <%= form_with url: manage_staffing_settings_path, method: :patch, class: "flex items-center justify-between gap-4" do %>
      <%# Marker param so an unchecked submit still routes to this setting. %>
      <%= hidden_field_tag :updating_coverage, "1" %>
      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer">
        <%= check_box_tag :alert_uncovered_show_roles, "1", Current.organization.alert_uncovered_show_roles?,
              class: "mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 text-pink-600 border-gray-300 rounded focus:ring-pink-500 accent-pink-500" %>
        <span>
          <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Run Role Call on my shows</span>
          <span class="block text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">
            Covers every role set to "one shift per show" on the
            <%= link_to "roles page", manage_staffing_house_roles_path, class: "text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-700 underline" %>.
            Roles tied to a venue only count for shows at that venue.
          </span>
        </span>
      </label>
      <%= render "shared/button", text: "Save", variant: "primary", size: "medium", type: :submit %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
